            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Creates a new list. The `$name` and `$objectType` fields are required.\n\nSupports idempotency via the `Idempotency-Key` header.\n\n**[Required scope](/using-the-api/scopes/):** `lists:create`\n\n**[Rate limit category](/using-the-api/rate-limits/):** Write"
        },
